  "scope": "A local Kubernetes v1.36.1 kind API server only. Compare the runtime startup-reported native admission plugin names and API-server command/config identity against a versioned synthetic approved profile, inventory served API-based webhook/policy objects, and compare the same harmless server-side dry-run Pod request with only LimitRanger disabled in a disposable before cluster. The profile is illustrative and does not evidence organizational approval, production configuration, or managed-service scope. This release-review wrapper also compares stock and manifest-based Kubernetes v1.37.0 admission using the exact pinned kind node image. Its probes are limited to two named synthetic ConfigMaps and two named disposable ValidatingAdmissionPolicy API objects. No webhooks or external targets are contacted.",
